   "Statement": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" /><title>\r\n\t\t</title>\r\n\t\t<style type=\"text/css\">\r\n\t\t\t.cs778DBFE2{text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:5pt 0pt 5pt 0pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto}\r\n\t\t\t.csAC9CF2{color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:21pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;}\r\n\t\t\t.cs5E98E930{color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;}\r\n\t\t\t.csA16174BA{color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}\r\n\t\t</style>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<p class=\"cs778DBFE2\"><strong><span class=\"cs5E98E930\">Education: </span></strong></em><span class=\"csA16174BA\">1980 Whitman College, BA (Political Science and Chemistry), 1984 Seattle University (UPS), JD</span></strong></em></p><p class=\"cs778DBFE2\"><strong><span class=\"cs5E98E930\">Occupation: </span></strong></em><span class=\"csA16174BA\">District Court Judge</span></strong></em></p><p class=\"cs778DBFE2\"><strong><span class=\"cs5E98E930\">Statement: </span></strong></em><span class=\"csA16174BA\">Judge Harn brings more than 25 years of judicial experience to the King County District Court bench. She is currently the Assistant Presiding Judge and a member of the Court&#39;s Executive Commitee. Judge Harn makes our community safer, one careful and thoughtful decision at a time. &nbsp;She is fair, compassionate, patient and motivational. She strives each and every day to follow the law and to earn the trust and respect necessary to be an effective judge. Judge Harn thanks you for your vote and promises to continue to work with integrity to provide accessible justice for all. </span></strong></em></p></body>\r\n</html>\r\n",
